### Overrides applied on top of `.env` for the containers of the `app` compose profile.
### Inside the compose network the services are reachable by name on their default ports.

REDIS=redis://valkey:6379
POSTGRES=postgres://yhub:yhub@postgres:5432/yhub
POSTGRES_TESTING=postgres://yhub:yhub@postgres:5432/yhub-testing
S3_ENDPOINT=minio
S3_PORT=9000
